              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 1.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitanap Olaitoriani Yoshua olayioni le Nuni nejoki, “Tonyuaa nintagol oshoke; amu eilo iyie ayau nkera e Israel atua ina kop apa nainosie olmumai pee aisho ninche. Kaaku nanu tenebo iyie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eidip Musa aigero irorei lena kitanapata tiatua embuku, omeitabaiki enkiting'oto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitanap Musa lelo tung'ana loo Lawi apa oonap osanduku lo sotua lo Laitoriani ejoki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ewaita ena buku oo nkitanapat, nipikipiki embata eilo sanduku lo sotua lo Laitoriani Enkai inyi, pee etum ninye ataa teine shakenisho tialo intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ayiolo nanu enkiseroto o engolon enkong'u inyi; ng'ura, ena olong itogolong'akita intae Olaitoriani; kebaa naa kenya engolong'akinoto te siadi keeya ai! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enturrurrokoki nanu ilpayiani pooki loo loshon linyi, o larikok linyi pee atumoki airoro kulo rorei too nkiyiaa enye naipotu shumata o enkop meishakenoki ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ayiolo nanu ajo ore te siadi keeya ai meeta nchere miasiasa entorroni, nimbelekenyanya aapaash ina oitoi apa naitanapa nanu intae; naa ore too nkolong'i naapuonu nejing intae entorroni, enkaraki naa eiyookiki intae aas entorroni te dukuya Olaitoriani, aaitagor ninye tialo esiai oo nkaik inyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
